      "start_s": 16.57,
      "end_s": 31.27,
      "duration_s": 14.7,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "But by the formula written in Alaska's own law, the check should have been much bigger. The governor's office put the full amount at three thousand six hundred and fifty dollars per person. The legislature paid about a third of that.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "The governor's office",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 6.49,
          "absolute_s": 23.06
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "The legislature paid",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 12.06,
          "absolute_s": 28.63
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "The legislature paid",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 12.06,
          "absolute_s": 28.63
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "court",
        "pfd"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "s03_question",
      "segment": "h_question",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 31.27,
      "end_s": 36.77,
      "duration_s": 5.5,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "So where does this money come from? And why does the check keep shrinking?",
      "keyframes": [],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "s04_promise",
      "segment": "h_promise",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 36.77,
      "end_s": 51.87,
      "duration_s": 15.1,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "By the end of this video, you will know how oil money became a ninety billion dollar fund, how the dividend is paid, why the state now depends on it, and what economists found when they studied the checks.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "oil money became",
          "label": "items[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.35,
          "absolute_s": 40.11
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
