    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "s06_first",
      "segment": "m1_first",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 57.27,
      "end_s": 70.4,
      "duration_s": 13.13,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "The first check went out in nineteen eighty-two. It was one thousand dollars for every eligible resident. In total, the state paid out about four hundred and seventy-one million dollars that year.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "In total",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 7.62,
          "absolute_s": 64.89
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "In total",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 7.62,
          "absolute_s": 64.89
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "that year",
          "label": "items[1].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 12.19,
          "absolute_s": 69.46
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "pfd"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "s07_rules",
      "segment": "m1_rules",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 70.4,
      "end_s": 99.2,
      "duration_s": 28.8,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "The rules are simple. You must live in Alaska for the whole calendar year, and plan to stay there indefinitely. You must also have spent at least seventy-two hours in a row in the state during the past two years. In twenty twenty-five, six hundred and sixty-five thousand people applied, and six hundred and eighteen thousand were paid. That is most of a state with about seven hundred and thirty-nine thousand people.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "You must live",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 2.63,
          "absolute_s": 73.03
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "seventy-two hours",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.94,
          "absolute_s": 81.34
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "In twenty twenty-five",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 15.71,
          "absolute_s": 86.11
        },
        {
          "param": "items[3].at.cue",
          "cue": "In twenty twenty-five",
          "label": "items[3].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 15.71,
          "absolute_s": 86.11
        },
        {
          "param": "items[3].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "were paid",
          "label": "items[3].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 22.81,
          "absolute_s": 93.21
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "pfd"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "s08_history",
      "segment": "m1_history",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 99.2,
      "end_s": 129.83,
      "duration_s": 30.63,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "The amount changes every year. In twenty fifteen, the dividend reached two thousand and seventy-two dollars. The largest payment ever, in dollar terms, came in twenty twenty-two. With an extra energy relief payment, it was three thousand two hundred and eighty-four dollars. In twenty twenty-four, it was one thousand seven hundred and two dollars, again including energy relief. In twenty twenty-five, it was back down to one thousand dollars.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "In twenty fifteen",
          "label": "items[0].bars[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.25,
          "absolute_s": 102.45
        },
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "largest payment ever",
          "label": "items[0].bars[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.76,
          "absolute_s": 107.96
        },
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[3].at.cue",
          "cue": "In twenty twenty-four",
          "label": "items[0].bars[3].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 19.38,
          "absolute_s": 118.58
        },
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[4].at.cue",
          "cue": "In twenty twenty-five",
          "label": "items[0].bars[4].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 26.3,
          "absolute_s": 125.5
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "pfd"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "s09_total",
      "segment": "m1_total",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 129.83,
      "end_s": 147.63,
      "duration_s": 17.8,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Add it all up. From nineteen eighty-two to twenty twenty-five, the state paid out about thirty-one point three billion dollars in dividends. Someone who collected every single check would have received about fifty-two thousand eight hundred dollars, before inflation.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "in dividends",
          "label": "items[0].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.35,
          "absolute_s": 138.18
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Someone who collected",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.08,
          "absolute_s": 139.91
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Someone who collected",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.08,
          "absolute_s": 139.91
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "before inflation",
          "label": "items[1].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 16.27,
          "absolute_s": 146.11
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "pfd"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "p10_checks",
