      "type": "engine_draw",
      "start_s": 147.63,
      "end_s": 172.73,
      "duration_s": 25.1,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Let me draw the checks over time. Here is nineteen eighty-two, one thousand dollars. The bars rise and fall with the markets. A high point in twenty fifteen. A cut in twenty sixteen. A record in twenty twenty-two. And today, twelve hundred dollars. The check is a roller coaster, not a salary.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
