    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "s13_oil",
      "segment": "m2_oil",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 189.87,
      "end_s": 209.27,
      "duration_s": 19.4,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "In nineteen seventy-six, as oil money began to flow, Alaskans voted to change their constitution. At least twenty-five percent of the state's oil and mineral royalties would go into a permanent fund. Later, a state law raised that to fifty percent for newer leases.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "At least twenty-five",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.18,
          "absolute_s": 198.05
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Later, a state law",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 14.53,
          "absolute_s": 204.4
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "Later, a state law",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 14.53,
          "absolute_s": 204.4
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "law"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "s14_rooms",
      "segment": "m2_rooms",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 209.27,
      "end_s": 249.43,
      "duration_s": 40.17,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "The fund has two rooms. The principal is locked. The constitution says it cannot be spent. The earnings, the profits from investing it, go into a second account, called the earnings reserve. That second room is where the dividend comes from. At the end of June twenty twenty-six, the fund's managers reported about ten point six billion dollars of realized earnings in that room, plus four billion already set aside for the next year's draw. Unlike the principal, the legislature can spend this room through the yearly budget, as the HB two sixty-three budget did this year.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "The principal is locked",
          "label": "items[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 2.56,
          "absolute_s": 211.83
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "go into a second account",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.11,
          "absolute_s": 219.38
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "At the end of June",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 17.58,
          "absolute_s": 226.85
        },
        {
          "param": "items[3].at.cue",
          "cue": "At the end of June",
          "label": "items[3].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 17.58,
          "absolute_s": 226.85
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "apfc"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "s15_size",
      "segment": "m2_size",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 249.43,
      "end_s": 270.97,
      "duration_s": 21.53,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Today the fund is huge. At the end of June twenty twenty-six, it was worth about ninety-one point nine billion dollars. Of that, about fifty-nine billion was locked principal. In the last fiscal year, it earned a return of more than twelve percent, and the state drew about three point eight billion dollars from it.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "it was worth about",
          "label": "items[0].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 5.62,
          "absolute_s": 255.06
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "fifty-nine",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.47,
          "absolute_s": 259.9
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "In the last fiscal year",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 13.48,
          "absolute_s": 262.91
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "In the last fiscal year",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 13.48,
          "absolute_s": 262.91
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "apfc"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "s16_invest",
      "segment": "m2_invest",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 270.97,
      "end_s": 290.9,
      "duration_s": 19.93,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Here is the surprising part. The fund is no longer mainly an oil fund. Royalties added only about five hundred and thirty-five million dollars last year. Most of its value now comes from decades of investing in stocks, bonds and other assets around the world.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Royalties added",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 6.39,
          "absolute_s": 277.36
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "Most of its value",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 11.86,
          "absolute_s": 282.83
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "apfc"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "p17_vault",
      "segment": "m2_draw",
      "type": "engine_draw",
      "start_s": 290.9,
      "end_s": 310.5,
      "duration_s": 19.6,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Let me draw the vault. Here is the pipeline, bringing in oil royalties. They flow into the locked room, the principal. The investments grow, and the profits spill into the second room, the earnings reserve. And from that second room, the state takes its draw, and pays the dividend.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "draw_start.cue",
          "cue": "Here is the pipeline",
          "label": "draw_start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 2.53,
          "absolute_s": 293.43
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "cue": "Here is the pipeline",
          "label": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 2.53,
          "absolute_s": 293.43
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "cue": "the locked room",
          "label": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 6.9,
          "absolute_s": 297.8
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[3].start.cue",
          "cue": "The investments grow",
          "label": "strokes[3].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 9.26,
          "absolute_s": 300.16
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[2].start.cue",
          "cue": "the second room",
          "label": "strokes[2].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 12.04,
          "absolute_s": 302.94
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[4].start.cue",
          "cue": "the state takes its draw",
          "label": "strokes[4].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 16.27,
          "absolute_s": 307.17
        },
        {
          "param": "actions[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "and pays the dividend",
          "label": "actions[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 17.88,
