    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "s21_court",
      "segment": "m3_court",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 339.9,
      "end_s": 361.3,
      "duration_s": 21.4,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "A lawsuit followed, arguing that the dividend was protected by law. In twenty seventeen, the Alaska Supreme Court disagreed. Its words were clear. Without another constitutional amendment, the dividend must compete for funding every year, just like any other state program.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[2].hits[0].cue",
          "cue": "disagreed",
          "label": "items[2].hits[0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 9.04,
          "absolute_s": 348.95
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Its words were clear",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.48,
          "absolute_s": 350.38
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "court"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "s22_pomv",
      "segment": "m3_pomv",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 361.3,
      "end_s": 385.37,
      "duration_s": 24.07,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "In twenty eighteen, the legislature set a new rule. Each year, the state may draw five percent of the fund's average value from recent years. The idea was a steady, predictable payout instead of a new fight every year. That single draw now pays for two things at once. The dividend, and the rest of the state government.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Each year, the state may draw",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 4.54,
          "absolute_s": 365.84
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "That single draw",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 16.55,
          "absolute_s": 377.85
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "That single draw",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 16.55,
          "absolute_s": 377.85
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "law"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "s23_budget",
      "segment": "m3_budget",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 385.37,
      "end_s": 407.03,
      "duration_s": 21.67,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "And the government needs it badly. In fiscal year twenty twenty-five, by our calculation from the state's revenue forecast, the Permanent Fund supplied about fifty-eight percent of the state's general revenue. Oil supplied only about thirty percent. The fund has replaced oil as Alaska's biggest paycheck.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "the Permanent Fund supplied",
          "label": "items[0].bars[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.71,
          "absolute_s": 394.08
        },
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Oil supplied",
          "label": "items[0].bars[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 14.25,
          "absolute_s": 399.62
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "has replaced oil",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 17.77,
          "absolute_s": 403.14
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "rev"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "p24_pie",
      "segment": "m3_draw",
      "type": "engine_draw",
      "start_s": 407.03,
      "end_s": 426.6,
      "duration_s": 19.57,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Let me draw the tug of war. Here is the yearly draw from the fund, one pie. On one side, the dividend checks. On the other side, schools, roads and everything else the state pays for. Every dollar that goes to one side cannot go to the other.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "draw_start.cue",
          "cue": "Here is the yearly draw",
          "label": "draw_start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.12,
          "absolute_s": 410.15
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "cue": "Here is the yearly draw",
          "label": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.12,
          "absolute_s": 410.15
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "cue": "the dividend checks",
          "label": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 7.7,
          "absolute_s": 414.73
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[2].start.cue",
