      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "s28_budget",
      "segment": "m4_budget",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 450.97,
      "end_s": 470.3,
      "duration_s": 19.33,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "The final budget paid a dividend of one thousand dollars, estimated at about six hundred and seventy-four million dollars in total. It added a two hundred dollar energy relief payment, but only if the state's revenue came in high enough. It did, and the final check was twelve hundred dollars.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "paid a dividend of",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 1.35,
          "absolute_s": 452.32
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "It added",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.9,
          "absolute_s": 459.87
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "It did",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 15.35,
          "absolute_s": 466.32
        },
        {
          "param": "items[3].at.cue",
          "cue": "It did",
          "label": "items[3].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 15.35,
          "absolute_s": 466.32
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "law",
        "pfd"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "s29_draw2",
      "segment": "m4_draw2",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 470.3,
      "end_s": 490.57,
      "duration_s": 20.27,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "To pay for all of it, the same budget drew about four billion dollars from the fund's earnings reserve. By our calculation, most of that money went to running the state, not to the checks. The dividend, in other words, is now the smaller part of the fund's yearly paycheck.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "earnings reserve",
          "label": "items[0].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 6.16,
          "absolute_s": 476.46
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "By our calculation",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.08,
          "absolute_s": 478.38
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "law"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "s30_skip",
      "segment": "m4_skip",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 490.57,
      "end_s": 510.1,
      "duration_s": 19.53,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "The fund itself felt the squeeze too. Normally, part of the earnings is moved into the principal to protect it from inflation. This year, according to the fund's managers, that one point five billion dollar transfer did not happen, because the legislature did not approve it.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "This year",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 9.63,
          "absolute_s": 500.2
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "This year",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 9.63,
          "absolute_s": 500.2
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "apfc"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "p31_ghost",
      "segment": "m4_draw",
      "type": "engine_draw",
      "start_s": 510.1,
      "end_s": 528.43,
      "duration_s": 18.33,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Let me draw the ghost check. Here is the real check, twelve hundred dollars. Above it, faint, the check the old formula would have paid, three thousand six hundred and fifty. The gap between them is the money the state kept to run its government.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "draw_start.cue",
          "cue": "Here is the real check",
          "label": "draw_start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.04,
          "absolute_s": 513.14
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "cue": "Here is the real check",
          "label": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.04,
          "absolute_s": 513.14
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "cue": "Above it, faint",
          "label": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 6.68,
          "absolute_s": 516.78
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[2].start.cue",
          "cue": "The gap between them",
          "label": "strokes[2].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 13.23,
          "absolute_s": 523.33
        },
        {
          "param": "actions[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "run its",
          "label": "actions[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 16.57,
          "absolute_s": 526.67
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "court",
